   "body": "Seen again in a whole GUI run (chromium, concurrency 4, load 80-160) at 1f156ba40/761904b5a:\n\n```\ntest at proto-menu-overflow.test.cjs:67:5\n✖ chromium zh: a quota picker taller than the window clamps and scrolls (3470.992458ms)\n  AssertionError [ERR_ASSERTION]: the last account was picked and saved: undefined\n      at TestContext.<anonymous> (internal/gui/tests/proto-menu-overflow.test.cjs:110:14)\n```\n\nAlone it passes 2 of 2, on an origin/main 0d2a10116 copy and at 761904b5a alike. Not taking it.",
